  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Not to be confused with **pensar** (to think), which does have an e→ie stem change — **pesar** does not",
    "Related noun: **el peso** (weight); also the currency name in several Latin American countries",
    "Common usage: *pesar una maleta* (to weigh a suitcase), *me pesa* (it weighs on me / I regret it — figurative use)"
